  "details": "1. Open VRChat in PC VR mode.\n\n2. Load into the default VRChat home. Note that it looks normal.\n\n3. Load into the following world: https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_66178418-2a25-423d-809b-358e8b2da6c7\n\n4. Load back into the default VRChat home world.\n\n5. From the starting area of the home world, note that the outline of the mirror, and the backside of the green scrolling barcode, can be seen THROUGH the solid objects in front of them.\n\n6. Load into various other worlds; you'll probably see similar artifacts in all of them (possibly much, much more prominently).\n\n7. Quit VRChat, then re-launch it, and observe that the default home world is back to normal.",
